{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7664457882222725419","title":"创意视频制作-2027校招","description":"1、负责建设运营中长视频帐号矩阵，负责帐号内容规划、运营策略制定；\n2、负责品牌/产品的玩法\u0026评测视频的拍摄制作，以创作出足够有趣、打动人心的内容作品为目标；\n3、通过用户洞察，持续从用户中获取对内容的反馈，基于数据实现定期复盘，追踪视频表现，总结经验，提炼方法。","requirement":"1、本科及以上学历，影视相关专业，应聘者须提供个人作品集，这将有助于更好地评估内容创作能力；\n2、具备较强的创意视频制作能力，包括犀利的话题角度、敏锐的网感、精准的内容节奏把控等；\n3、熟练操作主流拍摄设备，精通布光理论并具备实操经验；能熟练使用无人机、稳定器等辅助设备；\n4、精通Premiere Pro、DaVinic Resolve（含调色）等剪辑软件；熟练使用After Effects进行特效包装；\n5、有多个爆款内容案例，熟悉 电子数码/科技产品领域者优先；\n﻿﻿6、除视频创作，同时也擅长图片、文案的创作者优先。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1784521294457,"channel_online_status":1,"job_id":"7664457882222577963","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"recommend_job_post_List":[]},"message":"ok","error":null}